Package: batimentsequipements
Type: Package
Title: Matrice d'accessibilité — bâtiments × équipements (couche de dérivation)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Calum", "Robinson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "calum@example.com")
Description: Pure derivation layer on the matrice d'accessibilité (bâtiment ×
    TYPEQU × mode atomique): schema validation, kept-list selection, the
    div_loss family, cluster isolation shares, and territory aggregates.
    The once-run's matrix contract follows ADR-0001/0002 and the tracer
    run-strategy (D3/D4/D10).
